  "statement_html": "<div class=\"wims_question\"><b><span class=\"ecrit_1\">Michel</span></b>, <b><span class=\"ecrit_2\">Andrea</span></b> et <b><span class=\"ecrit_3\">Maeva</span></b> se partagent <b>60</b> billes selon le ratio \\(\\textcolor{red}{9} : \\textcolor{blue}{1} : \\textcolor{maroon}{2}.\\)<p> Déterminer le nombre debilles que recevra chaque personne.</p></div>\t<ul class=\"wims_nopuce\">\t<li>On commence par déterminer le nombre total de parts.</li>\t<li>On peut illustrer la situation par le dessin suivant :</li>\t<li>Part de <span class=\"ecrit_1\">Michel</span> <span class=\"unepart part_1 ecrit_1\">AAA</span> Part de <span class=\"ecrit_2\">Andrea</span> <span class=\"unepart part_2 ecrit_2\">AAA</span>\tPart de <span class=\"ecrit_3\">Maeva</span> <span class=\"unepart part_3 ecrit_3\">AAA</span>\t<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"wimscenter wimsborder wims_matrix\"><caption>Nombre total de parts</caption>\n  <tr><td><div class=\"unepart part_1\"> </div></td> <td><div class=\"unepart part_1\"> </div></td> <td><div class=\"unepart part_1\"> </div></td> <td><div class=\"unepart part_1\"> </div></td> <td><div class=\"unepart part_1\"> </div></td> <td><div class=\"unepart part_1\"> </div></td> <td><div class=\"unepart part_1\"> </div></td> <td><div class=\"unepart part_1\"> </div></td> <td><div class=\"unepart part_1\"> </div></td> <td><div class=\"unepart part_2\"> </div></td> <td><div class=\"unepart part_3\"> </div></td> <td><div class=\"unepart part_3\"> </div></td></tr>\n</table></div></li>\t<li><label for=\"reply1\">Avec le ratio \\(\\textcolor{red}{9} : \\textcolor{blue}{1} : \\textcolor{maroon}{2}\\), <span class=\"ecrit_1\">Michel</span> reçoit  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"3\"></span> parts </label><label for=\"reply2\"> pendant que <span class=\"ecrit_2\">Andrea</span> reçoit  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"3\"></span> part </label> et\t<label for=\"reply3\"><span class=\"ecrit_3\">Maeva</span> reçoit  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"3\"></span> parts </label>.</li>\t<li><label for=\"reply4\">Le partage est donc composé de </label> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"3\"></span> parts égales.</li>\t<li>Comme il y a 60 billes,<label for=\"reply5\"> chaque part est composée de</label>\t <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5\" data-size=\"3\"></span> billes.</li>\t<li><label for=\"reply6\"><span class=\"ecrit_1\">Michel</span> reçoit</label>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply6\" data-size=\"3\"></span> billes.</li>\t<li><label for=\"reply7\"><span class=\"ecrit_2\">Andrea</span> reçoit</label>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7\" data-size=\"3\"></span> billes.</li>\t<li><label for=\"reply8\"><span class=\"ecrit_3\">Maeva</span> reçoit</label>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply8\" data-size=\"3\"></span> billes.</li>\t</ul>\t ",
